&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;572&quot; data-local-id=&quot;798c65502881&quot;&gt;Own the roadmap and outcomes for a part of the inference platform, aligning several cross-functional engineering teams across public API, routing, performance, reliability and enterprise enablement features.&lt;/p&gt;
